  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This deep-dive sector study will allow Orange Corners C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire to acquire and identify specific, high-potential niches in one of the four priority sectors targeted by the Orange Corners Program. This knowledge will improve the recruitment strategy and the business support during the programme and enhance the level of innovation of both the entrepreneurs and their products.</narrative>
  </description>
